たけどいざ終えてから考えてみると１ヶ月ってすごく短かったなって思います(｡･ω･｡)\n \n \n \n \n \n \n そしてそして幕張の一日目で、私達ひらがなけやき主演のドラマも発表されました。\n \n \n \n \n \n まさかひらがなけやき主演のドラマをさせて頂けるなんて思ってもいなかったからお話を聞いた時ビックリして声も出ませんでした。\n \n \n \n \n \n でも本当に恵まれているなと思います。\n \n だから絶対にいいドラマにしたいです。演技は初めてだけど頑張りたいです。\n \n \n \n \n \n みなさん、是非見てくださいね(・◇・)\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 本当にありがとうございました！！！\n \n \n \n \n \n みなさん、最高でした♡(*´∀｀*)人(*´∀｀*)♡\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ18P4276QHDMFRFFE1ZZC9C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n ＊佐々木美玲＊"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-21615":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"壁:かずみん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2014/11/10/8977351/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみも壁ドンしてー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2014/11/10/8977351/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゅん♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2014/11/10/8977351/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみん壁ありがと笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2014/11/10/8977351/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握の洋服♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/minami.hoshino/img/blog/minami.hoshino/img/2014/11/10/8977351/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{